      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka gwa mbere gwa Koreshi omukama wa Perisia, ekigambo eky'Omukama yagambire omu kanwa k'Omurangi Yeremia kibone kugobelera, Omukama achumbiza Koreshi omukama ogwo wa Perisia kuranga omu ngomaye yona, ashuba ahandika ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Koreshi omukama wa Perisia nagamba ati: Omukama Ruhanga ow'omw'iguru ampaire engoma zona z'ensi, kandi andagiire kumwombekera Rwensinga omuli Yerusalemu eya Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywena abantube buli omoi Ruhangawe abe nawe, kandi agye Yerusalemu eya Yuda, ayombeke bundi buhya Rwensinga y'Omukama Ruhanga wa Isiraeli niwe Ruhanga asingiire Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na buli omoi ayaruhonokireho hona hona mbali araba naikara, mbali ali, abantu bayo bamujunise efeza n'ezahabu n'ebintu n'ebitunganwa otabazire bihongo bya bweyendezi bya Rwensinga ya Ruhanga eli Yerusalemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho aimukwa abagurusi b'amahiga ga Yuda na Benjamini, n'abakuhani n'Abalevita, buli muntu owo Mwoyo wa Ruhanga yachumbiize kugenda kushuba kwombeka Rwensinga y'Omukama eli Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi batabani babo bona babajunisa ebikwato by'efeza, n'ezahabu, n'ebintu ebindi, n'ebitunganwa n'ebikozo by'eiguzi otabaliraine ebyagizirwe omu bweyendezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Omukama Koreshi kwakwo ashohoza ebikwato bya Rwensinga y'Omukama ebyo Nebukadineza yabaire anyagire Yerusalemu akabiteka rwensinga ya baruhangabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayabishohoize yabikwasa Mitiredati omuhanika, ogwo abibara abikwasa Sheshubaza omutwazi wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oru nirwo rubara rwabyo: Esinia 1,000 z'ezahabu, n'esinia 1,000 z'efeza, ebyotezo 29, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enyabya 30 z'ezahabu, na 2,410 z'efeza,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "2,410 z'efeza",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Enyabya z'efeza engeli ya kabili 410.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " n'ebikwato ebindi 1,000.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
